#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:5 bf65ee3239b34d12902b9e18b4b07d0b
msgid "QLAND Mode"
msgstr "QLAND 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:7 4caf8bc3d20346148219bc124b5486bf
msgid ""
"QLAND Mode attempts to bring the QuadPlane straight down at the position the"
" vehicle is located when the mode is entered, descending to "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT <Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` at "
":ref:`Q_WP_SPD_DN<Q_WP_SPD_DN>` until it reaches :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT "
"<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>`, at which point it continues to descend at "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD <Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD>` until landing."
msgstr ""
"QLAND 模式会尝试让 QuadPlane 在进入该模式时所处的位置竖直下降：以 :ref:`Q_WP_SPD_DN<Q_WP_SPD_DN>` "
"下降至 :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT <Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>`，到达 :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT "
"<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` 后，改以 :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD <Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD>` "
"继续下降直至着陆。"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:12 4fa888ac199840868a9622e5ffd95495
msgid ""
"QuadPlane will recognize that it has landed if the motors are at minimum for"
" 5 seconds and its altitude has not changed more than 0.2m for 4 seconds.  "
"It does not use the altitude itself to decide whether to shut off the motors"
" except that the QuadPlane must also be below "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` above home(ie in the LAND FINAL "
"phase). The altitude change for the decision can be increased, in case the "
"altitude determination from the EKF is excessively noisy by increasing the "
":ref:`Q_LAND_ALTCHG<Q_LAND_ALTCHG>` value from its default value of 0.2m."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 会在电机保持最低转速5秒且高度变化不超过0.2m持续4秒时判定为已降落。它不会单独依赖高度本身来决定是否关闭电机，但 "
"QuadPlane 还必须位于 Home 点上方 :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` 以下（即处于 "
"LAND FINAL 阶段）。若 EKF 的高度判断噪声过大，可通过增大 :ref:`Q_LAND_ALTCHG<Q_LAND_ALTCHG>` "
"的值（默认为0.2m）来提高用于判定的高度变化阈值。"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:17 4bb70149a2034976b8d4be79afa42b85
msgid ""
"If the QuadPlane appears to bounce or balloon back up a couple of times "
"before settling down and turning the props off, try lowering the "
"``Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD`` parameter a bit."
msgstr ""
"如果 QuadPlane 在降落时出现弹跳或气球式反弹几次后才稳定停止并关闭螺旋桨，请尝试适当降低 ``Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:20 f22af47fb3fc4d06bb3d0c8090166c1c
msgid ""
"If the vehicle has GPS lock the landing controller will attempt to control "
"its horizontal position but the pilot can adjust the target horizontal "
"position just as in QLOITER mode."
msgstr "如果飞行器有 GPS 锁定，降落控制器将尝试控制其水平位置，但飞手可以像在 QLOITER 模式中一样调整目标水平位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:23 85a792c07b644c48978a4dac774916b1
msgid ""
"If the vehicle does not have GPS lock the horizontal control will be as in "
"QSTABILIZE mode so the pilot can control the roll and pitch lean angle of "
"the QuadPlane."
msgstr "如果飞行器没有 GPS 锁定，水平控制方式将与 QSTABILIZE 模式相同，飞手可以控制 QuadPlane 的横滚和俯仰倾斜角。"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:30 068ae0aad3c74712ba503a646b18e28e
msgid ""
"In any mode based on using the barometer: QLAND, QLOITER, QHOVER, QRTL, if "
"your QuadPlanes     operation becomes erratic when you are close to the "
"ground or landing (and also if any auto landing procedure results in "
"bouncing or failure to turn off motors properly after landing) you probably "
"have the autopilot situated such that its barometer (altimeter) is being "
"affected by the pressure created by the QuadPlanes prop-wash against the "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"在任何基于气压计的模式（QLAND、QLOITER、QHOVER、QRTL）中，若 QuadPlane "
"在靠近地面或降落时出现不规律动作（或任何自动降落过程中出现弹跳或降落后无法正常关闭电机的情况），可能是因为飞控的气压计（高度计）受到 QuadPlane"
" 螺旋桨气流冲击地面所产生的压力干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:39 6abda5fac9674d7faa89fe53a5f7fb8f
msgid ""
"This is easily verified by looking at the altimeter (baro alt) reading in "
"your logs and seeing if it spikes or oscillates when near the ground."
msgstr "可以通过查看日志中的高度计（baro alt）读数，检查其在靠近地面时是否出现尖峰或振荡，来验证是否存在此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:41 5a6b174afa984a509f29f076bbb0b444
msgid ""
"If this is a problem, move the autopilot out of prop wash effect or shield "
"it with an appropriately ventilated enclosure."
msgstr "如果存在此问题，请将飞控移至不受螺旋桨下洗气流影响的位置，或用具有适当通风的外壳对其进行屏蔽。"

#: ../../source/docs/qland-mode.rst:43 804eeb9db85741dd8f5ced2002f76f70
msgid "Success can be verified by flight test and by log results."
msgstr "成功与否可通过飞行测试及日志结果来验证。"
